WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.350
- As promised, I found
some old photos of you.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.720
Are you ready to go through them?

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.660
- Oh boy.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.585
- I'm excited, all right!

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:07.418
- All right, let's see what you got.

00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:09.822
- Here is the first one.

00:00:09.822 --> 00:00:10.655
Yes!

00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:11.488
(audience laughing)

00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:12.600
Oh my gosh, how old are you there?

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.790
- I think second grade.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.040
- Oh my god, you're adorable.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:15.873
Look at that.

00:00:15.873 --> 00:00:17.730
You had that big old hair going even then.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.260
You were like, "Y'all
ain't ready for my hair."

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.093
Okay, next.

00:00:22.138 --> 00:00:23.330
Yes!

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.163
- Okay.

00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:27.010
- I mean, it looks like
you're about to fall

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.500
with the horse but you're not.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.790
- Okay, two things,
three things about that.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.869
I've got the reins in the wrong hand.

00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:33.702
(laughs)

00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:37.510
That is my brother
Peck's calf roping horse,

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.040
he wasn't working too good for Peck

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.110
so Peck said I could run barrels on him,

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.350
and I am rocking the plaid pants.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:44.950
- Yes you are.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:45.960
Yes you are ma'am.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.050
Fashion icon before it really even hit.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.203
Okay, next.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.360
- [Reba] That day Kelly, I
won a car for six months.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.193
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:58.450
- I won a Ford Torino car for six months,

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.900
and all you had to do was fill out

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.830
your little questionnaire thing,

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:04.920
and then that is the cow wall cowboy

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.620
high school band right there.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.453
- Oh my God.

00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:08.286
- Oh you see the gal on the right,

00:01:08.286 --> 00:01:09.225
Roger Wills.

00:01:09.225 --> 00:01:12.600
He is the band leader for Alan Jackson.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.433
- Oh, no way!

00:01:13.433 --> 00:01:14.280
- And then Suzie's in the middle,

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.420
and Peck on the left.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.010
And Gary Rathburn and Kelly Ryan.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.540
- Your whole family sings.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.850
That's why I find I know that

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.040
and I know a lot of people do know that,

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.910
but it's insane like I'm talking like

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.830
everyone sings like well

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.030
Like it's crazy.

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:30.500
- Well daddy, somebody
asked daddy one time,

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.200
he said Clark, do you play?

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.474
He said I used to play on the linoleum.

00:01:34.474 --> 00:01:35.459
(laughs)

00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:36.550
- What?

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:37.961
I loved your dad.

00:01:37.961 --> 00:01:39.060
- He's a character.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:39.893
He loved you.

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:40.726
- I love it.

00:01:40.726 --> 00:01:42.020
Okay, next.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:43.450
Okay.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:44.283
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:44.283 --> 00:01:45.116
- Oh, that's Winona.

00:01:45.116 --> 00:01:46.440
- And Trisha.
- Is that Trisha?

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.273
- Yeah.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.120
Bruce Hinton.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.660
- Oh my gosh, look at Trisha.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.493
She's so cute.

00:01:50.493 --> 00:01:51.390
- [Kelly] Look at your hair,

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.320
you are so

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.153
look at all of y'all

00:01:53.153 --> 00:01:54.640
y'all are so cute.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.040
- [Reba] When was that?

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.660
- [Kelly] I don't know.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.313
You all have, are those records?

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.210
Those are all your records.

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:02.390
- Yeah.
- Oh my God.

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.450
This is what I'm talking about.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.060
See, this is 90's country right here.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.520
Like all these women
representing right now,

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.720
and like they don't play women now

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:11.750
hardly on country.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:12.950
What's wrong with y'all?

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:13.783
- They're missing out.

00:02:13.783 --> 00:02:14.630
- I know.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.904
Next.

00:02:15.904 --> 00:02:16.960
- [Kelly] This is us!

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.470
- [Reba] That was for the duets album.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:19.303
- [Kelly] It was.

00:02:19.303 --> 00:02:20.150
- [Reba] You came and sang with me.

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.000
- It was so magical.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.720
It's so funny because
remember we actually recorded

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.200
a different song first,

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.130
and then we ended up doing Crossroads,

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.790
and then we ended up doing Because Of You,

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.190
and it was such a magical moment.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.470
- Kelly, we look so young.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:31.303
- I know.

00:02:31.303 --> 00:02:32.784
I still look, I don't
what you're talking about.

00:02:32.784 --> 00:02:33.617
- Shut up.

00:02:33.617 --> 00:02:34.576
(laughs)

00:02:34.576 --> 00:02:36.310
- All right, next.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:37.233
- [Kelly] I was here.

00:02:37.233 --> 00:02:38.700
This is the Kennedy.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:39.840
- [Reba] The Kennedy Center Honors.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.300
Thank you for coming and singing for me.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.089
- I will do anything for you ever.

00:02:43.089 --> 00:02:43.922
- Thank you.

00:02:43.922 --> 00:02:44.889
Thank you very much.

00:02:44.889 --> 00:02:46.250
- This was really awesome.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.760
- It was a lot of fun.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:49.460
- I generally don't get nervous,

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.409
but I'll tell you what,

00:02:50.409 --> 00:02:53.201
I about peed my pants at that one.

00:02:53.201 --> 00:02:54.060
- You did great.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:54.893
- I was nervous.

00:02:54.893 --> 00:02:56.720
Okay, next.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.618
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:02:57.618 --> 00:03:01.771
(applause and cheering)

00:03:01.771 --> 00:03:03.180
Okay, ma'am.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:04.013
- Well.

00:03:04.013 --> 00:03:05.470
- Is this in Vegas?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.538
That's in Vegas.

00:03:06.538 --> 00:03:07.371
- Yeah.

00:03:07.371 --> 00:03:08.204
- Oh my gosh, next.

00:03:08.204 --> 00:03:09.037
(laughs)

00:03:09.037 --> 00:03:10.190
I feel bad about myself.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.023
This is awesome.

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:12.320
What's this?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.260
- That's when I was Ben
and no my 40th anniversary

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.010
with Ben in the Grand Del Opry.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:20.500
There's Vince Gill, Dolly
Parton, Carrie Underwood.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.260
(applause and cheering)

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.093
That's so sweet.

00:03:23.093 --> 00:03:25.890
- Wait, and you're actually
reuniting with Dolly and Carrie.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:27.950
- Yes, Dolly, Carrie, and I,

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.636
we are going to be co-hosting
the CMA Awards this year.

00:03:31.636 --> 00:03:32.798
- I love that!

00:03:32.798 --> 00:03:34.114
(applause and cheering)

00:03:34.114 --> 00:03:34.947
- [Reba] How about that?

00:03:34.947 --> 00:03:37.070
- I couldn't think of three
better women to do that.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:37.903
- Thank you.

00:03:37.903 --> 00:03:39.112
I'm thrilled to death that they asked me.

00:03:39.112 --> 00:03:40.137
- Yes.

00:03:40.137 --> 00:03:41.110
I mean what?

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.450
Of course they asked you.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.153
They were like we need a legend.

